WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.997 --> 00:00:07.079
This page shows the shape of the whole term at once, so no week ever surprises you.

2
00:00:07.079 --> 00:00:17.592
Read the rhythm row for each stretch of weeks. It shows which weeks meet live, which are independent, and where Study Week and the final project weeks sit.

3
00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:27.865
Note the weeks that change mode. Independent weeks carry an instructor update instead of a lecture. The week page always names its own mode at the top.

4
00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:37.147
Plan your heavy weeks early. Use the rhythm to spot where readings stack up against your other courses, then start those weeks earlier.

5
00:00:37.147 --> 00:00:39.749
Nothing here is graded.

6
00:00:39.749 --> 00:00:45.707
Where next: Open Calendar and Due Dates to put exact dates against this rhythm.
